        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move side-to-side through the ship’s corridors and unleash automatic fire against relentless waves of <strong>four-legged robot enemies</strong>.<br>Each wave grows stronger and larger, up to <strong>200 enemies at once</strong>, testing your reflexes, positioning, and weapon choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 Progression &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every destroyed enemy has a chance to drop a <strong>wooden crate</strong> containing one of three treasure chests:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟩 <strong>Ammo Chests</strong> – Restore ammo and expand weapon capacity (Small, Medium, Large).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ <strong>Life Chests</strong> – Replenish lives and improve survival (Small, Medium, Large).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>Weapon Chests</strong> – Unlock new weapons or upgrade existing ones through <strong>four rarity tiers</strong>: Regular, Silver, Purple, and Golden.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>6 unique weapons</strong>, each with distinct stats and upgrade paths.<br>Survive, collect, and upgrade to push further into the uprising.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Enemies &amp; Waves</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldiers</strong> – Common attackers, fast and numerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elites</strong> – Tougher units with higher damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> – Massive threats that demand everything you’ve got.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy defeated earns <strong>score points</strong> but any that breach your barrier will cost you lives and score.<br>Complete<strong> waves</strong> to finish a run and earn <strong>gold</strong> based on your unused chests. Gold can be spent to buy new chests for your next attempts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Compete Globally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your performance feeds into <strong>global leaderboards</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo</strong> – Daily, Weekly, and Monthly rankings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliances</strong> – Team up with friends, form alliances, and compete for the top of the group leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn glory, gold, and bragging rights as you climb through the ranks of the resistance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D third-person shooter with side-to-side movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-shooting, skill-based movement and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless enemy waves up to 200 units per round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and chest progression system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global and Alliance leaderboards with daily/weekly/monthly resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast sessions and high replayability.</p></li></ul>",
